{
  "name": "pubready",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Preflight for npm trusted publishing (OIDC): finds why `npm publish` from GitHub Actions or GitLab CI will fail with E404/E422/ENEEDAUTH before you burn a version, prints the exact npmjs.com trusted-publisher settings, and explains failed publish logs.",
